---
import InsertLayout from '../../layouts/InsertLayout.astro';
---

<InsertLayout
  title="Order received"
  description="What happens after you complete a Toledo Technologies checkout."
  noindex={true}
  heading="Order received"
  subheading="Here is exactly what happens next."
>
  <h2>This page is not your receipt</h2>
  <p>
    Landing here means your browser finished the checkout flow. It does not by
    itself confirm that a payment settled — a redirect can happen for several
    reasons, and we would rather tell you that than let this page imply
    something it cannot verify.
  </p>
  <p>
    We confirm every payment directly against the payment processor, not from
    this page. Your card issuer's own confirmation and the emailed receipt from
    our processor are the authoritative records.
  </p>

  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      We verify the completed session, the payment intent and the captured
      charge, and check that the amount, currency and agreed scope match the
      order you approved.
    </li>
    <li>
      You get a written confirmation from us that repeats the agreed scope, the
      amount and currency, and the acceptance checks we committed to.
    </li>
    <li>
      We deliver the agreed work, along with the tests and the handover notes
      needed to verify it yourself.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    You do not need to keep this page open, and you do not need to return to it.
    If you closed the tab before it loaded, nothing is lost.
  </p>

  <h2>If something looks wrong</h2>
  <p>
    If the amount, the currency or the scope does not match what you agreed,
    tell us before we begin the work. Reply to the thread where the order was
    agreed, or reach us through the
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. Quote the order reference from your
    processor receipt and describe what differs.
  </p>
  <p>
    We would rather correct an order than deliver against the wrong scope. If a
    charge was made in error, say so and we will reconcile it against our own
    records rather than ask you to prove it.
  </p>
</InsertLayout>
